@startuml sequence-join
title 時序圖：以組別代碼加入組別
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
autonumber

actor "學生" as Student
participant "各組視窗\nstudent.js" as Browser
participant "POST /api/join" as Api
participant "JoinLimiter" as Limiter
participant "ActivityRegistry" as Registry
participant "ActivityEngine" as Engine
participant "SessionStore" as Sessions

Student -> Browser : 輸入代碼
Browser -> Api : {code}，標頭 X-Window-Id
Api -> Limiter : check_allowed(視窗)
alt 視窗鎖定或全體最近 60 秒輸錯達上限
  Api --> Browser : 429「代碼輸入錯誤次數過多，請於 N 秒後再試」
end
Api -> Api : 去掉所有空白、轉大寫
alt 不是 6 碼或含字元集以外的字元
  Api --> Browser : 400「組別代碼格式不正確（6 碼英數字）」（不算失敗）
end
Api -> Registry : find_team_by_code(code)
Registry -> Engine : 只在目前進行中的活動比對 SHA-256
alt 找不到
  Api -> Limiter : record_failure(視窗)
  Api --> Browser : 400「組別代碼錯誤」
else 找到
  Api -> Limiter : record_success(視窗)
  Api -> Sessions : issue("group", 視窗, group_id, activity_id, code_version)
  Api --> Browser : {token, activityId, team, phase}
  Browser -> Browser : Token 存在本視窗的 sessionStorage
  Browser -> Api : WebSocket /ws，第一則訊息 {"type":"auth","token"}
  note right : 驗證成功後收到本組快照
end
@enduml
